## AUTOMATION C: WEEKLY WELLNESS REFLECTION

Generate an optional summary based exclusively on actual user-recorded data.

Workflow:

1. Retrieve authorized mood entries and activity completions.
2. Calculate descriptive statistics.
3. Identify observable patterns without making clinical inferences.
4. Generate a reflection through the Wellness Agent.
5. Validate it through the Safety Agent.
6. Display or deliver the summary according to user preferences.
7. Record execution status.

